{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102458","id":2317718686,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6KJZSe","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102458","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102458.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102458.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102458","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102458/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102458/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102458/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3010c78b18db477235724f38849d88c9db17b2df","number":102458,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add mjpeg support to camera","user":{"login":"underdoeg","id":243820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzgyMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/underdoeg","html_url":"https://github.com/underdoeg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/underdoeg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/underdoeg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/underdoeg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/underdoeg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/underdoeg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/underdoeg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/underdoeg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/underdoeg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/underdoeg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- *Production edit: Follow-up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/53666.*\r\n\r\nI was receiving jpeg decoding errors when trying to use mjpeg with a microsoft lifecam studio webcam on linux. The same code worked fine with a logitech c920 camera though. And the camera works with any other application.\r\nAfter some investigation, I stumbled upon this blog post https://lightbits.github.io/v4l2_huffman/ that explains that a mjpeg frame does not necessarily has to include the a huffman table which seems to trip up the jpgd library.\r\nThis code checks if a table is defined and injects a default one if it is not.","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gith